<font color="#ffffff">I would rather spend that energy</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">on the people I love.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

500
00:33:54,120 --> 00:33:56,080
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, hey, Santi.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

501
00:33:56,960 --> 00:33:58,080
