<font color="#ffffff">You are just so adorable.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

524
00:36:16,280 --> 00:36:19,200
<font color="#ffffff">This is my older brother's son.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

525
00:36:19,280 --> 00:36:25,520
