<font color="#ffffff">in an accident last month,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

526
00:36:25,600 --> 00:36:27,480
<font color="#ffffff">so I took Akekaphol in.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

527
00:36:27,560 --> 00:36:30,720
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, I'm so sorry for your loss, Sompob.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

528
00:36:31,320 --> 00:36:32,440
