537
00:37:01,160 --> 00:37:02,120
<font color="#ffffff">Give it back,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

538
00:37:02,760 --> 00:37:05,560
<font color="#ffffff">or I'll tell Mom!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

539
00:37:05,640 --> 00:37:08,680
<font color="#ffffff">You little tattletale.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I'm going to throw it away!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

540
00:37:14,600 --> 00:37:17,560
<font color="#ffffff">Don't throw it away! Give it back!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

541
00:37:18,160 --> 00:37:20,600
