544
00:37:29,440 --> 00:37:31,560
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, Dao.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

545
00:37:32,160 --> 00:37:33,920
<font color="#ffffff">Are you hanging out with Akekaphol?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

546
00:37:34,000 --> 00:37:37,360
