568
00:39:06,240 --> 00:39:08,120
<font color="#ffffff">I forgive you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

569
00:39:08,200 --> 00:39:10,400
<font color="#ffffff">You bully others</font><font color="#ffffff">
