570
00:39:10,480 --> 00:39:13,560
<font color="#ffffff">because you don't have</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">your parents, right?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

571
00:39:16,720 --> 00:39:18,800
<font color="#ffffff">Take it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

572
00:39:18,880 --> 00:39:22,320
<font color="#ffffff">I love this rabbit doll</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">more than anything.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

573
00:39:22,400 --> 00:39:27,200
<font color="#ffffff">I'm giving it to you to hug</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">whenever you miss your parents.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

574
