584
00:40:43,600 --> 00:40:44,760
<font color="#ffffff">Tell me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

585
00:40:45,360 --> 00:40:46,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'll handle it for you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

