587
00:40:52,520 --> 00:40:54,440
<font color="#ffffff">I need someone trustworthy.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

588
00:40:55,480 --> 00:40:57,280
<font color="#ffffff">Someone who won't betray us later.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

589
