592
00:41:46,920 --> 00:41:49,360
<font color="#ffffff">You're dead.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

593
00:41:49,440 --> 00:41:51,920
<font color="#ffffff">Stop right there, Fai!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

594
00:41:57,280 --> 00:42:01,720
<font color="#ffffff">Please, don't hurt me! I'm scared!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

595
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:03,880
<font color="#ffffff">You've got a lot of nerve, huh?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

596
00:42:04,800 --> 00:42:05,680
