<font color="#ffffff">I don't have the money!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

598
00:42:08,160 --> 00:42:11,960
<font color="#ffffff">Please don't hurt me. I'm begging you!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

599
00:42:12,040 --> 00:42:14,680
<font color="#ffffff">No money, no escape, no payment.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

600
00:42:14,760 --> 00:42:16,960
<font color="#ffffff">Great. You're getting a beatdown.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

601
00:42:17,040 --> 00:42:19,280
<font color="#ffffff">No.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

602
00:42:20,720 --> 00:42:22,160
<font color="#ffffff">No!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

603
00:42:22,240 --> 00:42:24,440
<font color="#ffffff">-Who's there?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Your father.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

604
00:42:25,080 --> 00:42:27,560
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Go!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

605
00:42:35,280 --> 00:42:36,280
<font color="#ffffff">Your name is Fai, right?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

606
00:42:37,800 --> 00:42:41,600
