616
00:43:33,600 --> 00:43:35,280
<font color="#ffffff">You have gambling debts at the casino.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

617
00:43:35,800 --> 00:43:37,880
<font color="#ffffff">And you owe Phanu for online gambling too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

618
