619
00:43:45,120 --> 00:43:47,000
<font color="#ffffff">but it can't be anything good.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

620
00:43:49,680 --> 00:43:55,880
<font color="#ffffff">Let me go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

621
00:43:55,960 --> 00:43:59,040
<font color="#ffffff">-Let me go, that hurts!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Choose!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

622
00:44:00,080 --> 00:44:01,360
<font color="#ffffff">Die like a dog,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

623
00:44:02,360 --> 00:44:03,960
<font color="#ffffff">or work for me and pay off all your debts.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

624
00:44:06,760 --> 00:44:08,800
<font color="#ffffff">I give up!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

625
00:44:08,880 --> 00:44:12,560
<font color="#ffffff">I give up!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Whatever you want me to do, I'll do it!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

626
00:44:13,400 --> 00:44:14,400
<font color="#ffffff">That wasn't so hard!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

627
00:44:15,000 --> 00:44:16,240
<font color="#ffffff">Stop being so dramatic.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

628
00:44:25,560 --> 00:44:30,000
<font color="#ffffff">So what is this thing you want me to do?</font><font color="#ffffff">
