629
00:44:32,000 --> 00:44:33,480
<font color="#ffffff">Wait for the boss's orders.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

630
00:44:34,360 --> 00:44:36,040
<font color="#ffffff">You'll find out soon enough.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

631
00:44:44,160 --> 00:44:46,560
<font color="#ffffff">Noach, a new Isan restaurant just opened</font><font color="#ffffff">
