632
00:44:46,640 --> 00:44:48,160
<font color="#ffffff">Want to go get some</font><font color="#ffffff"><font color="#ffffff"><i> soi ju </i></font><font color="#ffffff"><font color="#ffffff">tonight?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font></font>

633
