<font color="#ffffff">Petch! Are you practicing your music?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

638
00:45:05,560 --> 00:45:07,720
<font color="#ffffff">What's up, Kang? Noach?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

639
00:45:07,800 --> 00:45:10,840
<font color="#ffffff">I don't have anything, but he does.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">He was gossiping about you a lot.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

640
00:45:10,920 --> 00:45:12,520
<font color="#ffffff">-Ouch!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Noach.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

641
00:45:12,600 --> 00:45:13,880
<font color="#ffffff">My shoulder almost popped out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

642
00:45:13,960 --> 00:45:15,440
<font color="#ffffff">You were gossiping about Petch,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">weren't you?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

643
00:45:15,520 --> 00:45:17,120
<font color="#ffffff">What's it about? Lay it on me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

644
00:45:17,200 --> 00:45:19,960
<font color="#ffffff">Don't listen to this foul-mouthed Noach.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">He exaggerates.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

645
