<font color="#ffffff">I already cleared that up.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">It was just a misunderstanding.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

647
00:45:27,520 --> 00:45:28,720
<font color="#ffffff">Was it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

648
00:45:28,800 --> 00:45:31,800
<font color="#ffffff">-So Mr. Ake got punched for nothing?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Exactly.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

649
00:45:31,880 --> 00:45:33,560
<font color="#ffffff">I can hardly believe it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

650
00:45:34,600 --> 00:45:37,400
