<font color="#ffffff">for absolutely nothing?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

651
00:45:37,480 --> 00:45:39,280
<font color="#ffffff">-Right.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Kang.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

652
00:45:39,360 --> 00:45:42,080
<font color="#ffffff">You should try looking</font><font color="#ffffff">
