00:45:59,000 --> 00:46:00,840
<font color="#ffffff">Oh… Well…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

659
00:46:00,920 --> 00:46:02,280
<font color="#ffffff">Sorry, man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

660
00:46:02,360 --> 00:46:05,120
<font color="#ffffff">My mouth moved faster than my brain.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't mean to upset you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

661
00:46:08,000 --> 00:46:09,600
<font color="#ffffff">It's all right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

662
00:46:11,280 --> 00:46:13,040
<font color="#ffffff">My dad used to tell me</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

663
00:46:14,080 --> 00:46:16,560
<font color="#ffffff">that he wanted me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to face my problems head-on,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

664
00:46:17,440 --> 00:46:20,360
<font color="#ffffff">just like a sunflower</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that always faces the sun.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

665
00:46:23,200 --> 00:46:24,800
<font color="#ffffff">Mr. Nop always had great words of wisdom.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

666
00:46:25,680 --> 00:46:28,360
<font color="#ffffff">Speaking of him makes me miss him too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

667
00:46:30,840 --> 00:46:32,560
<font color="#ffffff">I miss him too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

668
00:46:33,360 --> 00:46:34,960
<font color="#ffffff">I miss him so, so much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

669
00:47:13,600 --> 00:47:16,440
<font color="#ffffff">PIMDUEAN PANJIN, NOP PANJIN</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

670
00:47:16,520 --> 00:47:17,680
<font color="#ffffff">That day</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

671
00:47:19,000 --> 00:47:21,160
<font color="#ffffff">feels like it was just yesterday, Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

672
00:47:24,560 --> 00:47:26,040
<font color="#ffffff">Do you know</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

673
00:47:28,040 --> 00:47:30,000
<font color="#ffffff">that since you passed away,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

674
00:47:31,520 --> 00:47:33,400
<font color="#ffffff">everything has changed?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

675
00:47:36,800 --> 00:47:38,680
<font color="#ffffff">Let me tell you all about it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

676
00:47:40,840 --> 00:47:42,880
<font color="#ffffff">I'm dating Dao now, Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

677
00:47:44,320 --> 00:47:47,080
<font color="#ffffff">Dao's dad actually accepts me too.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

678
00:47:47,160 --> 00:47:49,480
<font color="#ffffff">Hard to believe, right?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

679
00:47:49,560 --> 00:47:51,000
<font color="#ffffff">And on top of that,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

680
00:47:52,040 --> 00:47:55,120
<font color="#ffffff">Ake turned over a new leaf,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

681
00:47:55,200 --> 00:47:57,240
<font color="#ffffff">and he supports me now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

682
00:47:57,320 --> 00:48:00,360
<font color="#ffffff">Right now,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">everything is going beautifully, Dad.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

683
00:48:02,760 --> 00:48:04,360
<font color="#ffffff">But it's a shame</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

684
00:48:07,240 --> 00:48:08,920
<font color="#ffffff">you're not here with me anymore.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

685
00:48:30,680 --> 00:48:32,320
<font color="#ffffff">Let's have a drink together, Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

686
00:49:11,840 --> 00:49:14,080
<font color="#ffffff">I don't want to see you and Petch</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">happy together.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

687
00:49:15,280 --> 00:49:16,640
<font color="#ffffff">Why are you telling me this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

688
00:49:16,720 --> 00:49:19,920
<font color="#ffffff">Do you know what Mr. Nop said</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">before he died?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

689
00:49:20,000 --> 00:49:22,400
<font color="#ffffff">What did he say? Just tell me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

690
00:49:22,480 --> 00:49:24,120
<font color="#ffffff">You should meet me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

691
00:49:25,040 --> 00:49:27,760
<font color="#ffffff">Good girl. You're quite an actress.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

692
00:49:27,840 --> 00:49:29,320
<font color="#ffffff">NEXT EPISODE</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

693
00:49:29,400 --> 00:49:30,400
<font color="#ffffff">Hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

694
00:49:31,920 --> 00:49:34,440
<font color="#ffffff">It's time I get my revenge on you, Petch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

695
00:49:36,040 --> 00:49:39,320
<font color="#ffffff">Your life will be ruined</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

696
00:49:40,000 --> 00:49:41,640
<font color="#ffffff">in the next few hours.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

697
00:49:57,920 --> 00:50:04,000
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I wish I knew if I ever crossed your mind</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

698
00:50:04,080 --> 00:50:10,120
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I wish I knew if you heard the whisper</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

699
00:50:10,200 --> 00:50:16,160
<font color="#ffffff"><i>For my heart is crying out my love</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>It's deep and true</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

700
00:50:16,240 --> 00:50:21,280
<font color="#ffffff"><i>But never reaching you</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

701
00:50:22,160 --> 00:50:27,520
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I know that it simply cannot be</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

702
00:50:28,280 --> 00:50:33,360
<font color="#ffffff"><i>And I never want to cause you misery</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

703
00:50:34,720 --> 00:50:39,960
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I'm just an ordinary man</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Worth nothing at all</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

704
00:50:40,760 --> 00:50:46,000
<font color="#ffffff"><i>And I never want to make</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Your teardrops fall</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

705
00:50:47,600 --> 00:50:51,560
<font color="#ffffff"><i>You are out of reach</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

706
00:50:51,640 --> 00:50:57,640
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Is it a crime that I need you?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

707
00:50:59,320 --> 00:51:03,440
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Please let me know for sure</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

708
00:51:04,320 --> 00:51:09,400
<font color="#ffffff"><i>That you're the one I've been waiting for</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

709
00:51:10,320 --> 00:51:14,960
<font color="#ffffff"><i>How much longer can I bear this pain?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

710
00:51:16,360 --> 00:51:21,360
<font color="#ffffff"><i>How much longer must I wait in vain?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

711
00:51:22,400 --> 00:51:27,200
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I really don't know what move to make</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

712
00:51:28,160 --> 00:51:34,920
<font color="#ffffff"><i>To end this heartache</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>And say that I love you</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

713
00:51:43,160 --> 00:51:48,160
<font color="#ffffff">Subtitle translation by: Sarunpon T.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>
